Stack member 1:

[Instance 0] 
+-----------------------Key----------------------------------------+
| Rte = route entry index
| GroupIP  = multicast group ip address
| SourceIP = source ip address
| cmd = command
|       0=forward   1=mirror to CPU 2=trap to CPU   3=hard drop
|       4=soft drop 5=route         6=route&mirror  7=bridge&mirror
|       8=bridge    9=none
| Cntr = counter set
| CPU = mirror to CPU
| TTL = time to live hop limit
| RPFCm = reverse path forwarding (RPF) command
|       0=forward   1=mirror to CPU 2=trap to CPU   3=hard drop
|       4=soft drop 5=route         6=route&mirror  7=bridge&mirror
|       8=bridge    9=none
| RPFIf =reverse path forwarding (RPF) vlan id
| A = activity bit, 1 means route was hit
